Fall is the third season of the year. It's preceded by [[Summer]] and followed by [[Winter]].

Most of the Stardew Valley Expanded NPCs will attend the vanilla fall festivals - the [[Stardew:Stardew Vally Fair|Stardew Valley Fair]] on Fall 16, and the [[Stardew:Spirit's Eve|Spirit's Eve]] festival on Fall 27.

